<title>UK: Household Bank Nevada sets $70 mln seven-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Household Bank Nevada sets $70 mln seven-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HOUSEHOLD BANK NEVADA NA</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  HOUSEHOLD FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $70 MLN	 BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 FEB.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    +0.1875    PAY DATE    27.FEB.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS PRICE  99.93     FULL FEES   0.166</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    99.93</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
